        <h4>
              <a href="/publications/indirect-mineral-import-reliance-and-provenance">
        <span class="usa-sr-only usgs-screenreader-only">  Indirect mineral import reliance and provenance
</span>
                Indirect mineral import reliance and provenance

              </a>
          </h4>
    
<div class="field field--name--field-intro field--type--text-long field--label--hidden">
  
      <div  class="field-intro">  Mineral commodity supply chain analyses rely on international trade data reported by individual countries as quantities of a mineral commodity form imported from (or exported to) a partner. However, export quantities frequently exceed a country’s domestic production, or occur when no production data are reported, suggesting that the trade partner is merely an intermediary in a...

</div>
  
